			"type":"text",
			"text":"It's good to draft the [[031 - Utility Closet]] whenever possible, since this will give you the ability to manipulate the keycard system to turn it off, if couple with the [[Security Room]], this allows you to unlock all keycard doors while also increasing their spawn frequency.\n\nYou can also disable the negative bonus of the [[Gymnasium]], power up the [[014 - Garage.canvas|Garage]] and also turn the [[Dark Room]] lights on after drafting the room to prevent it from turning off.",
